      "blurb": "Non-Elemental: Sealing Art: Inanimate Puppet (C-Rank)",
      "summonRole": "Inanimate Puppet",
      "biography": "<p><em>Sealing Art: Inanimate Puppet (C-Rank) (Non-Elemental Ninjutsu).</em> It uses your Ninjutsu attack bonus and save DC. You command it as a Bonus Action; it can take reactions it's able to, such as opportunity attacks.</p><p><strong>Medium Construct.</strong> <strong>Armor Class</strong> 15 + 2 for every rank above C-Rank · <strong>Hit Points</strong> 20 + 10 for every rank above C-Rank · <strong>Speed</strong> 30 ft..</p><p><strong>Abilities</strong> STR +4 (save +2), DEX +2 (save +1), CON +4 (save +2), INT −5 (save −5), WIS +0 (save +0), CHA −5 (save −5). <strong>Damage Immunities</strong> Necrotic, Poison. <strong>Damage Resistances</strong> Bludgeoning. <strong>Damage Vulnerabilities</strong> Lightning. <strong>Condition Immunities</strong> Charmed, Exhaustion, Stunned, Envenomed. <strong>Senses</strong> passive Perception 10.</p><p><strong>Linked to you when summoned:</strong> AC and hit points by the rank you cast the jutsu at, and your Ninjutsu attack bonus and save DC.</p>"
